v><div class=\"character-spine\"><div class=\"no-select\" style=\"position:absolute; bottom:-10px\"><img alt=\"Pifuxiaorendi 008.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/a/ae/Pifuxiaorendi_008.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"240\" height=\"224\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"240\" data-file-height=\"224\" /></div><div><img alt=\"Spine static-301403 bnbn.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/3/30/Spine_static-301403_bnbn.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"343\" height=\"482\" class=\"img-fit mid-position\" data-file-width=\"343\" data-file-height=\"482\" /></div></div></div></div><div class=\"character-infobox\" style=\"display:block\"><div style=\"margin-bottom:20px\"><div style=\"position:relative; margin-top:5px\"><div style=\"position:absolute; top:-2px; user-select:none; pointer-events:none;\"><img alt=\"Chatacterskinviewtextbg blue.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/233px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"233\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/350px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"360\" data-file-height=\"36\" /></div><div style=\"margin-left:27px;position:relative;\">崭新形象</div></div><div style=\"position:relative; margin-top:5px\"><div style=\"position:absolute; top:-2px; user-select:none; pointer-events:none;\"><img alt=\"Chatacterskinviewtextbg blue.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/233px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"233\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/350px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"360\" data-file-height=\"36\" /></div><div style=\"margin-left:27px;position:relative;\">崭新单品</div></div></div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">可用角色：</span><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"3014\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%8A%AD%E5%A6%AE%E8%8A%AD%E5%A6%AE\" title=\"芭妮芭妮\"><img alt=\"Bgequip4.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/100px-Bgequip4.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/150px-Bgequip4.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/200px-Bgequip4.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\" style=\"width:60%; padding-top:7%;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%8A%AD%E5%A6%AE%E8%8A%AD%E5%A6%AE\" title=\"芭妮芭妮\"><img alt=\"芭妮芭妮\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/HeadIconSmall-301401.png/100px-HeadIconSmall-301401.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/0/0a/HeadIconSmall-301401.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%8A%AD%E5%A6%AE%E8%8A%AD%E5%A6%AE\" title=\"芭妮芭妮\">芭妮芭妮</a></span></span></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">实装版本：</span>3.3</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:3em\">来源：</span>活动</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">所属系列：</span>铁与高堡之歌</div></div><div><div class=\"grey-small test-hide hide-m\">编号ID：301403</div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E7.AA.97.E4.B8.AD.E4.BE.A7.E5.86.99_Garment_Display\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"窗中侧写_Garment_Display\">窗中侧写<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">Garment Display</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"infopad\"><b>芭妮芭妮的日程表</b><br />7:00 AM<br />准备早餐，大份的培根煎蛋搭配一杯黄油咖啡<br /><i>记得给客房的客人送餐！他昨天冲破了封锁线才到达这里，身上携带着重要的资料——据说这关乎30多位大人物的安危……我得帮助他，确保那些资料不落入重塑之手的手中。</i><br /><br />11:00 AM<br />为访客提供午餐<br /><i>这些访客来者不善——他们是来找人的。我当然知道他们在找谁！幸好我提前将客人藏了起来……但是，他们把我整理好的房间全部搞乱了！</i><br /><br />14:00 PM<br />帮助管家搬运今日的物资<br /><i>一点儿也不重！据说这批物资是从重塑之手那儿截获的，怪不得木箱摸起来黏糊糊的——真邋遢，他们完全不讲卫生吗？</i><br /><br />21:00 PM<br />准备就寝，但记得要给主人提供一些宵夜<br /><i>中午的访客竟然在台灯里装了窃听器！真狡猾！</i></div><div id=\"崭新单品\"></div><h2><span id=\".E5.B4.AD.E6.96.B0.E5.8D.95.E5.93.81_All-new_Item\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"崭新单品_All-new_Item\">崭新单品<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">All-new Item</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"char-item-box0 tabber\"><div class=\"char-item-box1 tabber-item\" data-skinid=\"301403\"><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-301404.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/9/97/Belonging-301404.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">“晨间交响乐”<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">\"Morning Tea Set\"</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />230<hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>一套供应饮料和点心的餐具。它们在不同的时代来到这座城堡，百年前的老主人偏爱那只银壶，他的曾孙女则对陶瓷茶杯情有独钟。而现在，它们都被一只有力的手轻轻托起，发出悦耳又富有层次感的叮当声，为每位房客带来佳肴与必要的关照。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-301405.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/a/a1/Belonging-301405.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">“白日定音鼓”<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">\"Emblem of Glory\"</div></div></div><div>无估值<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到60%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>金光闪闪的勋章，饰以红宝石和珍珠，不似寻常侍者所佩戴之物。这枚硕大的勋章究竟是来自皇室的嘉奖，还是颇有权势的人在暗中授予？受访者对此全无解释，面对那样明媚的笑脸，我们也确实无法追问到更多信息。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-301406.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/f/f3/Belonging-301406.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">“安睡小夜曲”<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">\"Night Watch\"</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />1<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到100%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>一串钥匙和一只安睡小熊，全天候守护城堡的秩序与安宁。倘若有小客人害怕夜幕的阴影，受访者就会留下小熊予以陪伴。“它力大无比，能驱逐所有坏人，还有一颗勇敢的心。”</div></div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E8.A1.A3.E7.9D.80.E6.B5.B7.E6.8A.A5\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"衣着海报\">衣着海报</span></h2><div style=\"display:flex; gap:10px; border:1px solid #b55829; width:fit-content\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%BE%8D%E8%80%85%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%80%E5%A4%A91.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 侍者的一天1.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%BE%8D%E8%80%85%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%80%E5%A4%A91.jpg/228px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%BE%8D%E8%80%85%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%80%E5%A4%A91.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"228\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%BE%8D%E8%80%85%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%80%E5%A4%A91.jpg/342px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%BE%8D%E8%80%85%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%80%E5%A4%A91.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%BE%8D%E8%80%85%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%80%E5%A4%A91.jpg/456px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%BE%8D%E8%80%85%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%80%E5%A4%A91.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1540\" /></a><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%BE%8D%E8%80%85%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%80%E5%A4%A92.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 侍者的一天2.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%BE%8D%E8%80%85%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%80%E5%A4%A92.jpg/228px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%BE%8D%E8%80%85%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%80%E5%A4%A92.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"228\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%BE%8D%E8%80%85%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%80%E5%A4%A92.jpg/342px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%BE%8D%E8%80%85%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%80%E5%A4%A92.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%BE%8D%E8%80%85%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%80%E5%A4%A92.jpg/456px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%BE%8D%E8%80%85%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%80%E5%A4%A92.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1540\" /></a></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "衣着"}], "displaytitle": "<span style=\"display:inline-block\"><span style=\"display: flex;flex-direction: column;\">侍者的一天 <small style=\"color: grey\">Service Fit for Royalty</small></span></span>"}}